  "details": "Upon loading a SDK3.0 avatar, the parameters on that avatar will equal something other than zero for a short time upon load. This can cause some layers to enable certain states other than the set default state. This can also stick the animator into a wrong state, even when there are transitions out of that state and the current requirements for that transition have been met.",
